// Greatest labeled margin strictly above the smallest kept margin.
// One margin returns nothing. A greater margin returns that margin.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mhigh ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mhigh rank

IMPULSE mhigh 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mhigh" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
